 "business": {
  "text": "We manufacture finished textiles by converting raw, unfinished fabric (commonly called “grey” or “greige” fabric) through a multi-step wet and dry processing sequence known as preparation, dyeing/printing and finishing. We manufacture a range of sarees (on both a white label basis and under our brand Revelo) and fabrics primarily for use in manufacturing three diverse styles of apparel: (i) kitenge and kanga, which we refer to as African print, (ii) modern apparel, such as shirts and pants, and (iii) other South Asian ethnic and traditional dresses and suits fabrics, including fabrics for salwar kameez.",
  "page": 192
 },
